: "**Rootie Tootie Western Shootie**  \nStep into the boots of a sharp-shooting cowboy in *Rootie Tootie Western Shootie*, a fast-paced and action-packed VR experience. Test your skills in the Wild West as you engage in thrilling shootouts across 10 playable maps.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- **Solo and Team Modes**: Take on the challenge alone or team up for an intense multiplayer showdown.\n- **Authentic Western Combat**: Experience dynamic shootouts that bring the spirit of the Old West to life.\n\nWhether you're looking to prove you're the fastest gunslinger or just enjoy some arcade-style fun, *Rootie Tootie Western Shootie* offers a unique and immersive take on the Western genre.\n\nGrab your revolver, partner. It's time to ride into the sunset!\n", "short_description": "Fast paced western shooter! Play solo or with teams against other players in old school western combat."}]}, "developer_name": "Virtual Axolotl", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualaxolotl.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Axolotl", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtualaxolotl.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24960734153542841"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/47339